    "description": {
      "content": "The Advance Auto Parts Catalog API provides programmatic access to the full product catalog including parts, accessories, batteries, and fluids. Supports vehicle fitment lookups by year/make/model/engine, part number searches, availability checks, pricing, and store inventory queries for professional and DIY customers.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Advance Auto Parts Support",
